  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "k3wEwRiKni+NoxhqrrRS0XOaDV8=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:31:23.711Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Fulcrum Digital's row in the Flowable sweep records two things: more than 1000 staff and a Jersey City base outside the EU. Both are disqualifiers under this brief, and together they close the row without further research.\n\nNothing else about the firm was gathered, which is consistent with how the sweep was run \u2014 mined from the vendor's partner page on 2026-08-18 and not imprint-swept, so only what the card printed made it onto the row. Where an exclusion applies on location and size alone, the qualitative criteria are never reached.\n\nThe note is worth keeping as a registry entry rather than a finding. If the geographic scope of the brief changes, size would still exclude Fulcrum Digital, which distinguishes it from the entries screened out on location alone.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- Fulcrum Digital (US Jersey City NJ) \u2014 fulcrumdigital.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> 1000+ staff. Non-EU \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:31:23.711061Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:31:23.711066Z"
    }
  },
